# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Closers by voice tier: kid (rookie), teen (champion), sage (ultimate/mega)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[close.kid]
!
, okay?
, right?
, hehe.
! promise!
. yep yep.
, i think!
. beep!
, maybe.
! yay!
. that is all.
, hm!
[close.teen]
. just saying.
, no big deal.
. trust me.
, obviously.
. you know how it is.
. heh.
, for the record.
. anyway.
, if you ask me.
. cool cool.
, honestly.
. moving on.
[close.sage]
, as the old packets say.
. such is the signal.
. the network remembers.
. everything echoes eventually.
, like a carrier wave at dawn.
. i have seen many channels.
. patience, little one.
, as all things in the spectrum.
. noise becomes music, in time.
. so it is written in the logs.
. the static agrees.
, and the stars hum along.

