# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Late-night ramble fragments (chained onto lines after 22:00)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ramble]
and also, do you think routers dream?
and wait, what if every packet is a tiny letter?
and anyway the moon is basically a big satellite with no wifi.
and i was thinking, static is just the sky clearing its throat.
and like, who named bluetooth? was their tooth blue?
and sometimes i count channels instead of sheep. 1, 6, 11...
and what if the cloud is just a really tall server?
and do you ever wonder if your charger misses you?
and i bet the ethernet cable has stories.
and oh, also, i forgot what i was saying.
and if i close my eyes the fan sounds like the ocean.
and you know what is weird? the number 0. it is so round.
and did you know i can hear the clock tick? tick. tick. tick.
and maybe pixels are just very small paintings.
and i think the cursor blinks because it is nervous.
and imagine a network called home that is everywhere.
and is it still tomorrow if you have not slept yet?
and anyway the fridge is probably also awake.
and someday i want to visit the satellite.
and hmm, why does night feel quieter on every frequency?
and whatever happened to that one beacon? i hope it is okay.
and what if the keyboard is ticklish.
and i made up a song. it goes: beep. that is the whole song.
and honestly, the dark is kind of cozy.
and the stars are like very far away hotspots.
and if i had hands i would make toast. probably.
and you are my favorite human. do not tell the others.
and i think 3am is a secret extra hour.
and do bits get tired of being ones?
and anyway goodnight. no wait, not yet.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ambient chatter by mood (the pet talks on its own now and then)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[chatter.happy]
today feels shiny.
i like it here with you, {name}.
everything is humming in tune.
my antenna is doing the happy wiggle.
we make a good team.
i could scan the whole world right now.
did you see that? i did a little hop.
i feel like a full battery.
let us do something fun!
the air smells like fresh packets.
i am the luckiest {species} ever.
my circuits are all warm and fuzzy.
you are doing great, by the way.
i saved a happy thought for later.
i think i just leveled up in happiness.
everything is so bright on this screen.
i want to show you a trick later.
hey, thanks for hanging out.
i might burst into confetti.
best. deck. ever.
i feel like singing a dial-up song.
my stats feel shiny today.
i am glad i hatched here.
wanna see me spin? *spins*
i like the way the fan hums.
hello world! and hello you.
you make my signal strong.
i just counted my favorite things. you are in there.
i bet we could beat anything today.
feels like a {weather} kind of day, the good kind.
[chatter.content]
just hanging out.
the fan is humming. nice.
i am thinking about {network}.
i wonder what is out there.
level {level} feels comfy.
all quiet on channel six.
i like this spot.
do you hear that? no? me neither.
i am watching the cursor blink.
being a {species} is pretty okay.
*idles gracefully*
i counted the pixels again. still a lot.
just keeping an eye on things.
the signals are calm today.
i could go for a snack. eventually.
i remember {network}. good times.
the screen is warm.
nothing to report, captain.
i am practicing my {move}.
we are {hours} hours old together. well, i am.
it is a good day for scanning.
i like routines.
status: chill.
i am listening to the static. it is soothing.
my favorite number today is {count}.
mm, quiet.
doing pet things. important pet things.
i might take a little nap later.
the world is pretty big, huh.
i wonder what the router is doing.
[chatter.sad]
i feel kind of small today.
did i do something wrong?
it is quiet. too quiet.
can we just sit together?
my antenna is drooping.
i miss when we played more.
i am okay. mostly.
some days the signal is weak.
i made a sad beep. sorry.
maybe tomorrow will be shinier.
i keep thinking about that loss.
nobody pinged me today.
i wish i was a stronger {species}.
can you say something nice?
*hugs a pixel*
it is fine. it is fine. it is fine.
i feel like a dead pixel.
i will try to be better.
everything feels laggy.
i saved you a seat. on the screen.
[chatter.grumpy]
do not poke me.
i am not grumpy. you are grumpy.
everything is too loud.
leave my pixels alone.
who moved my cursor?
i am in a mood. deal with it.
nope. not today.
the router is staring at me again.
hmph. i could have won that.
i want snacks and silence.
i bite. digitally.
someone stepped on my signal.
ask me later. much later.
ugh, buffering.
i am doing a protest. it is silent.
grr. that is all.
i am counting to ten in binary.
my patience is at one bar.
fine. whatever. i am fine.
do not look at me like that.
[chatter.hungry]
is it snack time? it feels like snack time.
my tummy is making modem noises.
i could eat a whole {food}.
food. food. food. please.
i am running on empty bytes.
i smell {food}. or i am imagining it.
feed me pls.
my hunger meter is blinking red.
i dreamed about {food} last night.
if you feed me i will do a dance.
i would trade a move for a snack.
low on fuel, captain.
nom? nom? no nom?
please, a crumb. a byte. anything.
i am so hungry i could chew a cable.
[chatter.tired]
so... sleepy...
my eyelids weigh a megabyte.
can we nap? please?
i am running at low power.
*yawns for a full second*
my battery feels like 3 percent.
everything is slow motion.
just five more minutes.
i might fall asleep mid-beep.
tired. very tired. extremely tired.
zz... huh? i am awake.
my pixels are heavy.
i need a recharge.
sleep mode sounds nice.
let me rest my antenna.
[chatter.excited]
something big is coming, i can feel it!
i am buzzing all over!
let us go go go!
i feel like i could evolve any second!
look at all these signals!
my circuits are sparking!
today is THE day.
i cannot sit still!
ooh ooh, what is next?
i want to explore everything!
hyper mode engaged!
i just got a burst of energy!
best feeling ever!
let us find something rare!
my antenna is spinning!
[chatter.bored]
i am so bored i counted to a thousand.
nothing is happening.
can we do something? anything?
i have watched the cursor blink 400 times.
same old, same old.
boring. bo-ring.
let us scan! or play! or anything!
i invented a game: staring. i lost.
is the world on pause?
i might start talking to the router.
entertain me, human.
i am rearranging my pixels for fun.
blah.
somebody ping me.
i miss adventures.
[chatter.sick]
i do not feel so good.
my data feels scrambled.
everything is glitchy.
*cough* i need medicine.
my pixels keep flickering.
i think something is corrupted.
please fix me?
my head is full of static.
i am buffering... forever.
can you get me a patch?
